WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.367
Check this out,

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:11.167
a word analogy!

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:13.533
Petal is to flower,

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:15.900
as wheel is to...

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:16.500
what?

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.100
A.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:17.700
Book,

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:18.300
B.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:18.867
House,

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:19.467
C.

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:20.067
Car,

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:21.267
or D.

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:21.867
Boat?

00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:23.033
Five seconds!

00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:30.033
TIME'S UP!

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:31.133
It's...

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:31.533
C,

00:00:31.533 --> 00:00:31.967
car!

00:00:31.967 --> 00:00:34.467
Petal is part of a flower,

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:36.967
so a wheel is part of

00:00:36.967 --> 00:00:37.833
a car.

00:00:38.967 --> 00:00:39.600
Okay,

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.500
a number series!

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.167
Eight,

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:42.800
twenty,

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:43.433
thirty-two,

00:00:43.433 --> 00:00:44.067
forty-four,

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:45.333
and then...

00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:47.233
what comes next?

00:00:47.233 --> 00:00:47.867
A.

00:00:47.867 --> 00:00:48.500
Fifty-five,

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:49.167
B.

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:49.800
Fifty-one,

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:50.433
C.

00:00:50.433 --> 00:00:51.067
Fifty-eight,

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:52.333
or D.

00:00:52.333 --> 00:00:52.967
Fifty-six?

00:00:52.967 --> 00:00:54.233
Five seconds!

00:01:00.033 --> 00:01:01.233
TIME'S UP!

00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:03.433
The answer is...

00:01:03.433 --> 00:01:03.933
D,

00:01:03.933 --> 00:01:04.433
fifty-six!

00:01:04.433 --> 00:01:07.467
Each number goes up by twelve,

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:10.500
so the next one is forty-four

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.533
plus twelve is fifty-six.

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:14.800
Here's one,

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:16.433
a picture puzzle!

00:01:16.433 --> 00:01:19.733
Where does the dot move next?

00:01:19.733 --> 00:01:20.300
A.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:20.833
Left,

00:01:20.833 --> 00:01:21.400
B.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:21.933
Bottom-right,

00:01:21.933 --> 00:01:22.500
C.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:23.033
Bottom-left,

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:24.133
or D.

00:01:24.133 --> 00:01:24.667
Top-right?

00:01:24.667 --> 00:01:25.767
Five seconds!

00:01:31.567 --> 00:01:32.767
TIME'S UP!

00:01:33.433 --> 00:01:34.667
The answer is...

00:01:34.667 --> 00:01:35.067
B,

00:01:35.067 --> 00:01:35.500
bottom-right!

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.967
The dot moves one spot clockwise

00:01:37.967 --> 00:01:40.000
around the grid each step,

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.467
so the next spot is bottom-right.

00:01:43.633 --> 00:01:44.033
So,

00:01:44.033 --> 00:01:46.067
are you smart or fart?

00:01:46.067 --> 00:01:48.500
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:49.700
find your rank!

00:01:50.867 --> 00:01:51.200
So,

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.600
how did you do?

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:53.967
Comment your score below,

00:01:53.967 --> 00:01:55.333
and follow for more!
